      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p><em>Ta\u1e25r\u012br-i \u1e62\u016bret-i I\u1e33l\u012bm el-Me\u2019\u1e2b\u016b\u1e95e Min \u1e62uveri\u2019l-e\u1e33\u0101l\u012bm ma\u2018a Ba\u1e25r\u00fc\u2019l-F\u0101rs Der-taf\u1e63\u012bl-i \u1e24ud\u016bd-i Vil\u0101yet-i M\u0131\u1e63r u Cif\u0101r el-Men\u1e33\u016ble Min Te\u1e33\u0101v\u012bmi\u2019l-em\u1e63\u0101r</em><span>: ... The land of Egpyt is located on the east of Arabian Peninsula.\u00a0Its southern frontier reaches the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"825\" data-is-only-node=\"\">bil\u0101d-\u0131 S\u016bd\u0101n</em><span>\u00a0(lands of the Sudan), that is\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"863\">N\u016bbe</em><span>\u00a0</span><span>(Nubia?)\u00a0</span><span>and the other non-tribes of dark faces, from whose direction the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"959\">N\u012bl-i M\u0131\u1e63r</em><span>\u00a0(Nile River) comes. And its northern boundary is the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1028\">Ba\u1e25r-i R\u016bm</em><span>\u00a0(Mediterranean Sea), and from\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1066\">Refa\u1e25</em><span>\u00a0(Rafah) to\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1085\">\u2018Ar\u012b\u015f</em><span>\u00a0(\u2018Arish),\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1103\">Cif\u0101r</em><span>,\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1119\">\u1e6c\u012bne</em><span>\u00a0(Tine/Al-Tina),\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1144\">Dimy\u0101\u1e6d</em><span>\u00a0(Damietta), the coast of\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1177\">Re\u015f\u012bd</em><span>\u00a0(Rosetta/Rashid), and\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1214\">\u0130skenderiyye</em><span>\u00a0(Alexandria); and passing between Alexandria it reaches\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1278\">Ber\u1e33a</em><span>\u00a0(Barqa/Cyrenaica). Its western boundary runs between\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1339\">Ber\u1e33a</em><span>\u00a0(Barqa) and\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1366\">\u0130skenderiyye</em><span>\u00a0(Alexandria) to the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1403\">Cenev\u012bz s\u0101\u1e25ili</em><span>\u00a0(Genoese coast) and\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1439\">\u1e92ahru\u2019l-v\u0101\u1e25\u0101t</em><span>, joins the frontiers of\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1496\">N\u016bbe</em><span>\u00a0(Nubia?). As for its southern boundary, it extends from the borders of Nubia to the cultivated lands by the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1619\">Ba\u1e25r-i \u1e32ulz\u00fcm</em><span>\u00a0(Red Sea), and finally reaches the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1667\">T\u012bh-i Ben\u012b \u0130sr\u0101\u2019\u012bl</em><span>. Then turning northward once again, it reaches the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1770\">Ba\u1e25r-i R\u016bm</em><span>\u00a0(Mediterranean) and ends at the place called\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1823\">Refa\u1e25</em><span>\u00a0(Rafah) where we began....\u00a0And the eastern border of Egypt extends from\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"322\">Ba\u1e25r-i \u1e32ulz\u00fcm</em><span>\u00a0(Red Sea) to the vicinity of\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"359\">Usv\u0101n</em><span>\u00a0(Aswan), and to\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"384\">\u2018Ay\u1e95\u0101b</em><span>\u00a0(Aidhab),\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"403\">Ku\u1e63ayr</em><span>\u00a0(Qusayr/Quseir),\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"429\">Kulz\u00fcm</em><span>\u00a0(Suez), and the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"473\">T\u012bh-i Ben\u012b \u0130sr\u0101\u2019\u012bl...</em><span>\u00a0[partial translation]</span></p>",
